{"id":"hdf-libs-0bg","title":"Remove deprecated Statistic_Hash.skipped field","description":"The `Statistic_Hash.skipped` field is marked as deprecated with instruction to use `notApplicable` or `notReviewed` instead. Deprecated fields should not be in v2.0.0 schema - they should be removed.\n\n## Rationale\n- v2.0.0 is a breaking change release - perfect time to remove deprecated fields\n- Deprecated field adds confusion and maintenance burden\n- Users have clear migration path: use notApplicable or notReviewed\n\n## Changes Required\n\n### Schema Changes (TDD Approach)\n\n1. **Update tests first**\n   - Remove `skipped` from test fixtures\n   - Add tests that verify skipped field is not accepted\n   - Update tests to use notApplicable or notReviewed instead\n\n2. **Update schema**\n   - statistics.schema.json: Remove `skipped` field from Statistic_Hash\n   - Regenerate types\n\n3. **Verify converters don't use skipped**\n   - Check all converters for references to \"skipped\" statistics\n   - Ensure no converter populates the skipped field\n   - Update any that do to use notApplicable or notReviewed\n\n### CRITICAL: Legacy HDF Converter\n\n**Must verify legacyhdf-to-hdf converter handles this correctly:**\n\n1. **v1 → v2 conversion (legacyhdf-to-hdf)**\n   - v1.0 HDF format may have `skipped` status\n   - Converter must map v1 `skipped` → v2 `notApplicable` or `notReviewed`\n   - Check conversion logic and add mapping if missing\n   - Add tests for skipped status conversion\n\n2. **v2 → v1 conversion (if supported)**\n   - If converter supports v2→v1, map notApplicable/notReviewed → skipped\n   - Verify backward compatibility\n\n### Files to Check\n- `hdf-schema/src/schemas/primitives/statistics.schema.json`\n- `hdf-schema/test/hdf-results.test.ts`\n- `hdf-converters/converters/legacyhdf-to-hdf/**/*` (CRITICAL)\n- All other converters (grep for \"skipped\")\n\n### Validation Steps\n1. Run legacyhdf-to-hdf converter on fixtures with skipped status\n2. Verify output uses notApplicable or notReviewed\n3. Verify no other converter references skipped\n4. All tests pass\n\n## Breaking Change\nThis is a breaking change. Users with v1.0 HDF files containing skipped status will need to use the legacy converter.\n\n## Priority\nMedium - Cleanup of deprecated field, but requires careful legacy converter verification\n\n## Dependencies\n- Should be done after nullable→optional conversion\n- Related to overall v2.0.0 schema cleanup","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","owner":"will@dower.dev","created_at":"2026-02-01T20:59:24Z","created_by":"Will Dower","updated_at":"2026-02-22T19:22:45Z","closed_at":"2026-02-06T10:56:31Z","close_reason":"Closed"}
