{"id":"hdf-libs-6b0.2","title":"Implement aws-config converter","description":"Port AWS Config compliance scanner converter from heimdall2. Convert tool output to HDF v2.0 format.\n\nImplemented in hdf-converters/converters/aws-config-to-hdf/go/ with CLI integration in hdf-cli/cmd/hdf/cmd/converter_aws_config.go.\n\nInput format: ConfigRulesFile JSON ({\"ConfigRules\": [...]}) — each rule bundles ConfigRuleId, ConfigRuleName, ConfigRuleArn, Description, Source.SourceIdentifier, InputParameters, and its EvaluationResults.\n\nField mappings match heimdall2/SAF CLI reference: ConfigRuleId as control ID, '{accountId} - {ruleName}' title, NIST lookup via SourceIdentifier, 'config_rule_name: ..., resource_type: ..., resource_id: ...' code_desc, run_time from timestamp diff, check description with ARN+SourceIdentifier+params. Fixtures sourced from SAF CLI sample data structure.","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","owner":"will@dower.dev","created_at":"2026-01-27T13:11:27Z","created_by":"Will Dower","updated_at":"2026-02-18T23:28:15Z","closed_at":"2026-02-19T00:00:00Z","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"hdf-libs-6b0.2","depends_on_id":"hdf-libs-6b0","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-02-22T19:18:39Z","created_by":"bootstrap","metadata":"{}"}]}
{"id":"hdf-libs-6b0.2-saf-research","title":"Research SAF CLI / heimdall2 aws-config converter design for input format and field mapping","description":"Both heimdall2 and SAF CLI aws-config converters use live AWS SDK calls (credentials + region), not a static file. Our converter must be file-based. Determine:\n\n1. What static export format should users generate? Options:\n   a. `aws configservice describe-config-rules` + `get-compliance-details-by-config-rule` merged into a combined JSON\n   b. Just EvaluationResults (current approach) with rule metadata in a separate file\n   c. A custom combined format we define\n\n2. Fix field mapping gaps vs reference implementation:\n   - Control ID: use ConfigRuleId (e.g. 'config-rule-7hytm9'), not ConfigRuleName\n   - Title: '{accountId} - {ConfigRuleName}' (account ID from ConfigRuleArn)\n   - NIST lookup: use Source.SourceIdentifier (UPPERCASE) not rule name\n   - code_desc format: 'config_rule_name: {name}, resource_type: {type}, resource_id: {id}'\n   - Message (failed only): '{codeDesc}: {Annotation || default msg}'\n   - run_time: ResultRecordedTime - ConfigRuleInvokedTime (seconds)\n   - check description: include ARN, SourceIdentifier, InputParameters\n   - source_location.ref: ConfigRuleArn\n\n3. Source real fixtures from SAF CLI (~/repos/saf/test/sample_data/aws/) or heimdall2. The SAF CLI has aws_config_hdf.json (output) but we need the raw AWS API input format.\n\nReference files:\n- ~/repos/heimdall2/libs/hdf-converters/src/aws-config-mapper.ts\n- ~/repos/saf/src/commands/convert/aws_config2hdf.ts\n- ~/repos/saf/test/sample_data/aws/aws_config_hdf.json","status":"closed","priority":0,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"2026-02-18T23:59:00Z","updated_at":"2026-02-19T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2026-02-19T00:00:00Z"}
