{"id":"hdf-libs-8qo","title":"hdf-cli: improve test coverage for stats and query gaps","description":"Mutation testing (Gremlins) identified two clusters of uncovered mutations in hdf-cli.\n\n## Gap 1: stats.go — status counters (10 uncovered mutations, lines 84–90 and 174–180)\nThe `++` counter increments for `StatusError`, `StatusNotReviewed`, and `StatusSkipped` in both the global stats accumulator and the per-baseline breakdown are never exercised. Tests only create controls with `passed`/`failed`/`not_applicable` status.\n\n**Fix**: Add test cases in `stats_test.go` that include controls with `error`, `not_reviewed`, and `skipped` result statuses and assert the counter values are non-zero.\n\n## Gap 2: query.go — compareImpact operators (7 uncovered mutations, lines 329–333)\nThe `compareImpact` function has a switch over `\u003e`, `\u003e=`, `\u003c`, `\u003c=`, `=` but tests only cover the equality case via `--impact` flag. The boundary comparison branches (`\u003e0.5`, `\u003e=0.7`, `\u003c0.4`, `\u003c=0.3`) are not tested.\n\n**Fix**: Add `query_test.go` cases using each impact operator (`\u003e`, `\u003e=`, `\u003c`, `\u003c=`) and verify correct filtering.\n\n## Other minor gaps\n- `convert.go:87-89`: The error message branch for \"both source and dest formats unrecognized\" — add a test that uses two completely unknown format names and checks the error message contains the expected suggestion text.\n- `list.go:177`: `truncateTitle` length edge case — test a title exactly at the max length boundary.\n\n## Stryker config\n`hdf-utilities/stryker.config.cjs` is in place for re-running. Use `gremlins unleash --timeout-coefficient 20` for Go.\n\n## Resolution\nAdded to `stats_test.go`: `TestCalculateStats_AllStatuses` (unit, all 6 statuses via EffectiveStatus), `TestStatsCommand_AllStatuses_JSON` (integration, schema-valid result statuses covering notApplicable/notReviewed/error branches). Added to `query_test.go`: `TestQueryCommand_TextOutput_ImpactFilter` (exercises \u003e, \u003e=, \u003c operators and the fmt.Printf text path), `TestQueryCommand_TextOutput_TitleTruncation` (56+ char title → `title[:52]+\"...\"`). Added to `convert_test.go`: `TestConvertCommand_ErrorMessages` (covers all 3 branches of `buildConverterNotFoundError`).","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","owner":"will@dower.dev","created_at":"2026-02-18T22:30:00Z","created_by":"Will Dower","updated_at":"2026-02-22T19:22:51Z","closed_at":"2026-02-18T23:28:15Z"}
