{"id":"hdf-libs-q8i","title":"Rename inspecVersion to toolVersion for tool-agnostic schema","description":"The field `Evaluated_Baseline.inspecVersion` is InSpec-specific and should be generalized to `toolVersion` to support any security scanning tool.\n\n## Changes Required\n\n### Schema Changes\n- `hdf-results.schema.json`: Rename `inspecVersion` → `toolVersion` in Evaluated_Baseline\n- Update description to be tool-agnostic\n- Update any references in other schemas\n\n### Type Regeneration\n- Rebuild TypeScript types from schema\n- Rebuild Go types from schema\n\n### Converter Updates\n- Update all converters to use `toolVersion` field\n- nessus-to-hdf: Set toolVersion to Nessus version\n- sarif-to-hdf: Set toolVersion to SARIF tool version\n- legacyhdf-to-hdf: Map inspecVersion → toolVersion in v1→v2 conversion\n- legacyhdf-to-hdf: Map toolVersion → inspecVersion in v2→v1 conversion\n\n### Test Updates\n- Update all test fixtures to use toolVersion\n- Update test assertions\n- Add tests for legacy inspecVersion handling in legacyhdf converter\n\n### Documentation\n- Add to breaking changes list\n- Document migration path for existing data\n- Update examples in README\n\n## Breaking Change\nThis is a breaking change for HDF v2.0.0. Existing files with `inspecVersion` will need to be migrated.\n\n## Priority\nMedium - Affects schema design and tool compatibility","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","assignee":"claude","owner":"will@dower.dev","created_at":"2026-02-01T20:58:49Z","created_by":"Will Dower","updated_at":"2026-02-22T19:22:56Z","closed_at":"2026-02-04T12:27:45Z","close_reason":"Renamed inspecVersion to toolVersion in schema. Updated test, schema, and regenerated types. All 423 tests passing. TDD approach followed: test first, then schema change."}
